  "description": "The §3Simulation Chamber§r acts as your digital mob grinder. By inserting your §5models§r and a §4Flaming Matrix§r, it generates §emob predictions§r. These predictions can then be redeemed for mob drops at the §bLoot Fabricator§r.

Upgrading your §5models§r directly improves their ability to produce accurate and useful predictions. Once a prediction is successful, take it to the §bLoot Fabricator§r to select your desired mob drop.


---


Here are a couple of useful features:

Efficiency: One §bLoot Fabricator§r can use mob predictions from up to four §3Simulation Chambers§r at once.

